SUMMARY:Ensemble: Within and Beyond... - Ecstatic Dance Wave w/ DJ SeigeA 
 (CJ O'Reilly)
DESCRIPTION:Asheville Movement Collective\nFriday\, November 6th\nEvening 
 Dance Wave 7:00 pm \\- 9:00 pm \\| Warmup 7pm \\| Opening Circle 7:30pm\nF
 acilitator DJ SeigeA (CJ O'Reilly)\n\nIntention: Ensemble: Within and Beyo
 nd...\n\nYour first dance partner is yourself.\n\nThe second is the floor.
 \nBut between those two\; an infinite array of partners:\nyour body - its 
 joints\, tendons\, muscles...\nyour mind - its thoughts\, memories\, imagi
 nings...\n\nAnd beyond that\, the music... another dancer... Third... four
 th.. beyond!\n\nStart from that first... work with each partner... listen 
 deeply\, and find your way to an integrated ensemble.\n\n## About DJ Seige
 A (CJ O'Reilly)\n\nCJ O'Reilly has been creating ecstatic dance waves for 
 the Asheville community since 2014. Their eclectic mix of musical styles b
 eckons dancers into new patterns of movement and expression through divers
 e time signatures and instrumentation\, and a wide range of musical and em
 otive qualities. CJ's waves explore high peaks\, beautiful vistas\, juicy 
 lowlands and the profound reflective stillness of tranquil water. CJ's dan
 ce waves are pre-produced and refined through the body and ears of a dance
 r and audiophile.\nFind more of DJ SeigeA's dance waves at [https://dj.sei
 gea.com](https://dj.seigea.com)\n\n\\~\\~\\~\n\n\\*\\* Please note that th
 e dance starts at Warm up. The doors close promptly at Opening Circle and 
 any that come late will be turned away. Please be on time to ensure a safe
  and secure container. \\*\\*\nTicket Prices: $15 - $30 or name your price
 .\n\nNo one turned away for lack of funds!\nPre-registration Recommended:\
 n\nVOLUNTEER!\n\nWe need volunteers. Volunteer and dance for free! Registe
 r to volunteer at:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/](h
 ttps://ashevillemovementcollective.org/volunteer/?fbclid=IwZXh0bgNhZW0CMTA
 AYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMDA4OTIAAR4XG
 dFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem_nrjKIXdVB1po
 otRUE4YAfA)\n\nIMPORTANT ANNOUNCEMENTS:\n\nDoor will close at the beginnin
 g of the opening circle. Please note: NO ENTRY AFTER OPENING CIRCLE BOTH W
 AVES!\n\nCollective agreements:\n[https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/
 our-dance/](https://ashevillemovementcollective.org/our-dance/?fbclid=IwZX
 h0bgNhZW0CMTAAYnJpZBExMFZWQ0ZzTmFlam10YUN0RXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgy
 MDA4OTIAAR4XGdFINP8qUH1XAETf8I71UKxgUcbNb_LMLwgnJWEzr2I_3ELhDttUv2i1OA_aem
 _nrjKIXdVB1pootRUE4YAfA)\n\nAbout AMC:\nAsheville Movement Collective envi
 sions a world that moves in harmony where all are free to be their authent
 ic selves within a loving community. Our mission and aim are to inspire au
 thenticity and healthy community through free-form dance by hosting dance 
 waves for personal and community transformation. AMC is a 501(c)(3) nonpro
 fit organization.\n\nLocation: 50 Bell Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28805\n\nSee yo
 u on the dance floor!
